3. db_connection
----------------

    Project:  db_connection
    Source:   https://github.com/elixir-ecto/db_connection
              specifically pull request 108
              https://github.com/elixir-ecto/db_connection/pull/108
    Author:   James Fish
    Licence:  Apache License, Version 2.0
    Applies:  src/pgo_pool.erl

db_connection ships no LICENSE file at its repository root. Its licence is
declared as "Apache-2.0" in the package section of mix.exs, and its README
carries the notice "Copyright 2015 James Fish" followed by the standard Apache
License, Version 2.0 boilerplate. Those are the sources for the licence and
copyright stated above.

src/pgo_pool.erl is an Erlang port, made in pgo, of the Elixir pool proposed in
that pull request, and has been changed further since.


